# The deploy serves the app (index.html + src/) and the landing page (site/).
# Nothing else needs a public URL, and vercel.json in particular should not be
# fetchable: it publishes the exact security headers the site relies on.
# outputDirectory is "." because the app must stay at the root, so the surface
# is trimmed here rather than by restructuring the app.
tests/
package.json
package-lock.json
verify.mjs
vercel.json
.gitignore
.vercelignore
README.md
check-links.mjs
# dev-only: screenshots, the provenance writer, the measurement harness.
# None of it is secret, none of it needs a public URL, and keeping the
# deploy surface to exactly what a visitor uses is the point.
tools/
docs/
